From f651171e8c6df31de9670299a49f5f1050020f7a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Owen Williams <owenoak@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 10:07:48 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] netlists P4:  Tree Columns -- <ui-tree mode="columns">: 
 Miller columns from <ui-tree-item>s or an items property (lazy children),
 path, keys, counts, column filter, docs examples

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
